# LF in the index and in every checkout, Windows included. Git for Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would check the patches out CRLF, and
# then not one of them applies to MicroPython's LF tree (and the overlay's
# series id, a hash of the patch bytes, would differ from Linux's).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.jpg binary
*.h264 binary
